SUMMARY:Beauty and the Beast (2010)
LOCATION:Cinema 21\, 616 NW 21st Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5271;-122.6975
DESCRIPTION:Dir. David Lister · 90 min\n\nA twist on the morality tale of 
 forbidden love between the beautiful Belle and the feared Beast. As the vi
 llagers are being brutally murdered and the Beast is hunted down as the on
 e responsible for the mayhem\, Belle and Beast team up to defeat the real 
 killer\; the power-hungry witch's malevolent troll.\n\nTickets: https://ti
 cketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/31186?siteToken=02fhxgcv98zq7pswjm69s8n9
 tc\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/31186?siteToken=02fhxgcv98z
 q7pswjm69s8n9tc
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cinema-21-20261107T1315-everest-the-other-side-2026@small-screens-pdx
DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261107T211500Z
DTEND:20261107T231000Z
SUMMARY:Everest: The Other Side (2026)
LOCATION:Cinema 21\, 616 NW 21st Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5271;-122.6975
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Jimmy Chin · 115 min\n\nAn intimate portrait of two peopl
 e bound by love\, ambition\, and the pursuit of the impossible. Elite ski 
 mountaineers Jim Morrison and Hilaree Nelson fell deeply in love while rea
 ching the pinnacle of their sport. Their drive sharpened into a shared dre
 am: to climb and ski the direct North Face of Mount Everest—the most dif
 ficult and dangerous climb on the mountain and the most coveted ski line o
 n Earth—something only a handful have ever achieved\, and no one has suc
 cessfully skied down.\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purch
 ase/31410?siteToken=02fhxgcv98zq7pswjm69s8n9tc\n\nMore showtimes: https://
 mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/31410?siteToken=02fhxgcv98z
 q7pswjm69s8n9tc
END:VEVENT
